{"id":"ef558a31b9ea6e9c","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/781_Bochvar_外部三值逻辑.md","title":"781 Bochvar 外部三值逻辑","display":"781_Bochvar_外部三值逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"781-Bochvar-外部三值逻辑\">781 Bochvar 外部三值逻辑</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{B3e}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{B3e}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\n\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{ext}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\n\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{ext}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{B3e}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{B3e}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{ext}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{ext}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B,\\mathsf E A\">\\(p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B,\\mathsf E A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{B3e}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{B3e}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\">\\(\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\">\\(\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ext}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\">\\(\\operatorname{ext}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>自由变元函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{B3e}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{B3e}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(\\operatorname{ext}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(\\operatorname{ext}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{B3e}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{B3e}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Subst}_{B3e}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{B3e}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\}\\)</span>，并定义替换扩张算子</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}_{B3e}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{B3e}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ext}_{B3e}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{B3e}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{B3e}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{B3e}(\\sigma)\\)</span> 为唯一满足下列递归子句的映射：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{ext}(A))=\\operatorname{ext}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{ext}(A))=\\operatorname{ext}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子；相应函数与关系的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{B3e}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{B3e}),\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,B3e}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{B3e}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{B3e}),\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,B3e}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{B3e}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,B3e}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{B3e}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,B3e}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-外部-Bochvar-三值矩阵\">4. 外部 Bochvar 三值矩阵</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V_{B3e}=\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf n,\\mathbf t\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_{B3e}=\\{\\mathbf t\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf V_{B3e}=\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf n,\\mathbf t\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_{B3e}=\\{\\mathbf t\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>底常元解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_{B3e}=\\mathbf f\">\\(\\bot_{B3e}=\\mathbf f\\)</span>。内部联结词为本条目中的下列函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{B3e}:\\mathsf V_{B3e}\\to\\mathsf V_{B3e},\n\\qquad\n\\wedge_{B3e},\\vee_{B3e}:\\mathsf V_{B3e}^2\\to\\mathsf V_{B3e}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_{B3e}:\\mathsf V_{B3e}\\to\\mathsf V_{B3e},\n\\qquad\n\\wedge_{B3e},\\vee_{B3e}:\\mathsf V_{B3e}^2\\to\\mathsf V_{B3e}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其具体子句为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{B3e}\\mathbf t=\\mathbf f,\\quad\n\\neg_{B3e}\\mathbf f=\\mathbf t,\\quad\n\\neg_{B3e}\\mathbf n=\\mathbf n,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_{B3e}\\mathbf t=\\mathbf f,\\quad\n\\neg_{B3e}\\mathbf f=\\mathbf t,\\quad\n\\neg_{B3e}\\mathbf n=\\mathbf n,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a=\\mathbf n\\text{ 或 }b=\\mathbf n\n\\Rightarrow\na\\wedge_{B3e}b=\\mathbf n,\\quad a\\vee_{B3e}b=\\mathbf n,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a=\\mathbf n\\text{ 或 }b=\\mathbf n\n\\Rightarrow\na\\wedge_{B3e}b=\\mathbf n,\\quad a\\vee_{B3e}b=\\mathbf n,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf t\\}\">\\(\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf t\\}\\)</span> 上：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf t\\wedge_{B3e}\\mathbf t=\\mathbf t,\n\\qquad\n\\mathbf f\\wedge_{B3e}\\mathbf t\n=\n\\mathbf t\\wedge_{B3e}\\mathbf f\n=\n\\mathbf f\\wedge_{B3e}\\mathbf f\n=\n\\mathbf f,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf t\\wedge_{B3e}\\mathbf t=\\mathbf t,\n\\qquad\n\\mathbf f\\wedge_{B3e}\\mathbf t\n=\n\\mathbf t\\wedge_{B3e}\\mathbf f\n=\n\\mathbf f\\wedge_{B3e}\\mathbf f\n=\n\\mathbf f,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf f\\vee_{B3e}\\mathbf f=\\mathbf f,\n\\qquad\n\\mathbf t\\vee_{B3e}\\mathbf f\n=\n\\mathbf f\\vee_{B3e}\\mathbf t\n=\n\\mathbf t\\vee_{B3e}\\mathbf t\n=\n\\mathbf t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf f\\vee_{B3e}\\mathbf f=\\mathbf f,\n\\qquad\n\\mathbf t\\vee_{B3e}\\mathbf f\n=\n\\mathbf f\\vee_{B3e}\\mathbf t\n=\n\\mathbf t\\vee_{B3e}\\mathbf t\n=\n\\mathbf t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>外部断定算子的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_{B3e}:\\mathsf V_{B3e}\\to\\mathsf V_{B3e}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_{B3e}:\\mathsf V_{B3e}\\to\\mathsf V_{B3e}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其逐点定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_{B3e}(\\mathbf t)=\\mathbf t,\\qquad\nE_{B3e}(\\mathbf f)=\\mathbf f,\\qquad\nE_{B3e}(\\mathbf n)=\\mathbf f.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_{B3e}(\\mathbf t)=\\mathbf t,\\qquad\nE_{B3e}(\\mathbf f)=\\mathbf f,\\qquad\nE_{B3e}(\\mathbf n)=\\mathbf f.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-赋值、公式值与反例证书\">5. 赋值、公式值与反例证书</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{B3e}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{B3e}\\to\\mathsf V_{B3e}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{B3e}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{B3e}\\to\\mathsf V_{B3e}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{B3e}\">\\(v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{B3e}\\)</span> 的扩张具有类型</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\to\\mathsf V_{B3e},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\to\\mathsf V_{B3e},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{bot})=\\bot_{B3e},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{bot})=\\bot_{B3e},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\neg_{B3e}\\overline v(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\neg_{B3e}\\overline v(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{B3e}\\overline v(B),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{B3e}\\overline v(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{B3e}\\overline v(B),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{B3e}\\overline v(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{ext}(A))=E_{B3e}(\\overline v(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{ext}(A))=E_{B3e}(\\overline v(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>反例证书函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{B3e}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{B3e}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{B3e}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{B3e}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{B3e}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{B3e}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{B3e})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{B3e}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{B3e}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{B3e}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{B3e})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{B3e}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-语义后承\">6. 语义后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{B3e}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{B3e}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{B3e}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{B3e}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{B3e}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{B3e}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valid}_{B3e}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{B3e}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubRule}_{B3e}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{B3e}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SubRule}_{B3e}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{B3e}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-语义证书与证明对象排除\">7. 语义证书与证明对象排除</h1>\n<p>语义证书函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{B3e}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\{\\star\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{B3e}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\{\\star\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\)</span>，定义可核验证书对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{B3e}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{B3e}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{B3e}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{B3e}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{B3e}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{B3e}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{B3e}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{B3e}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{B3e}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{B3e}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显式性约束：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{B3e}\">\\(\\mathsf{Valid}_{B3e}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{B3e}\">\\(\\Vdash_{B3e}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{B3e}\">\\(\\mathsf{SemCert}_{B3e}\\)</span> 均由本文件的真值集合、指定值集合、赋值扩张和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{B3e}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fail}_{B3e}\\)</span> 定义；不引用外部代数类、公式类或命名基逻辑。</p>\n<p>形式证明规则关系的类型及取值声明为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{B3e}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{B3e}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{B3e}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{B3e}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本条目是外部 Bochvar 三值矩阵语义后承系统；因此不定义非空 Hilbert 公理集合、证明序列或由规则生成的可证关系。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个语义形式系统\">8. 整个语义形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{B3e}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{B3e},\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e},\\operatorname{BV}_{B3e},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{B3e},\\operatorname{Ext}_{B3e},\\equiv_{\\alpha,B3e},\n\\mathsf V_{B3e},\\mathsf D_{B3e},\\bot_{B3e},\n\\neg_{B3e},\\wedge_{B3e},\\vee_{B3e},E_{B3e},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{B3e},\\overline{(\\cdot)},\\mathsf{Fail}_{B3e},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{B3e},\n\\Vdash_{B3e},\\mathsf{Valid}_{B3e},\\mathsf{SubRule}_{B3e},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{B3e}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{B3e}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{B3e},\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{B3e},\\operatorname{BV}_{B3e},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{B3e},\\operatorname{Ext}_{B3e},\\equiv_{\\alpha,B3e},\n\\mathsf V_{B3e},\\mathsf D_{B3e},\\bot_{B3e},\n\\neg_{B3e},\\wedge_{B3e},\\vee_{B3e},E_{B3e},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{B3e},\\overline{(\\cdot)},\\mathsf{Fail}_{B3e},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{B3e},\n\\Vdash_{B3e},\\mathsf{Valid}_{B3e},\\mathsf{SubRule}_{B3e},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{B3e}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统的目标差异是新增外部断定构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf E\">\\(\\mathsf E\\)</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_{B3e}(\\mathbf n)=\\mathbf f\">\\(E_{B3e}(\\mathbf n)=\\mathbf f\\)</span>；该条目只定义语义后承、反例证书和代换保持关系，不等同于内部 Bochvar 逻辑。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"781-Bochvar-外部三值逻辑","text":"781 Bochvar 外部三值逻辑","level":1},{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、替换与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-外部-Bochvar-三值矩阵","text":"4. 外部 Bochvar 三值矩阵","level":1},{"id":"5.-赋值、公式值与反例证书","text":"5. 赋值、公式值与反例证书","level":1},{"id":"6.-语义后承","text":"6. 语义后承","level":1},{"id":"7.-语义证书与证明对象排除","text":"7. 语义证书与证明对象排除","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个语义形式系统","text":"8. 整个语义形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{B3e}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\n\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{ext}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{B3e}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{ext}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}.","display":true},{"tex":"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B,\\mathsf E A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{B3e}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{B3e}","display":false}